IMAPAccount qmail
Host imap.foxmail.com
User essensea@foxmail.com
PassCmd "gpg -q --for-your-eyes-only --no-tty -d ~/.password-store/mail/qmail.gpg"
TLSType IMAPS
TLSVersions +1.2

IMAPStore qmail-remote
Account qmail

MaildirStore qmail
Path ~/.local/share/mail/qmail/
Inbox ~/.local/share/mail/qmail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel qmail
Far :qmail-remote:
Near :qmail:
Patterns "*" # "*" All folders
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
CopyArrivalDate yes

